NOTE ON BUNDLED THIRD-PARTY ASSETS

This repository ships a small number of static assets under lib/ that are not
covered by the MIT license above: the UI font (Roboto Condensed, Apache-2.0)
and the preset station logos (trademarks of their respective broadcasters,
included only for identification of the preset stations). See doc/assets.md for
provenance and licensing of each bundled asset.

The media backends (shairport-sync, nqptp, go-librespot, and the Bluetooth stack
BlueZ + bluez-alsa) are built from source by the Buildroot image under their own
upstream licenses; no prebuilt binaries are distributed in this repository.
